<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-27T13:25:59.938Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 13:25:59 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have escalated attacks across northern Nigeria, killing Islamic scholar Sheikh Yahaya Masussuka in his home and killing multiple civilians in Plateau, including seven in one community and a 60‑year-old woman harvesting groundnuts. In eastern Nigeria, gunmen killed at least ten people, while in Taraba state a mass shooting in Binnari left 62 dead and dozens injured. Kidnappers abducted six residents in Kaduna and three vigilantes died in a separate Plateau incident. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBPeXVzUlRTUkp1QjItMjlzRGJYU1hmMmMtd3ROX1ZTUXFZZkRxVnVpUlU5dXlPRmRZem9BVFZPTm9SSzFfWGYyTlNvMXpWcjVCUTFnZGtyajNvZDBHRGfSAWNBVV95cUxPU3YzTV92alZ0UERRbVk4c2drM2J6X05GN0NjVFFGMmRKZmxGbDZEN1BWLWlnSEF1eW1kamF2TjJzcEJMbTRMSF9CcTVSTDRVbkYzU2VlTmJFWHI3QjR0b3lUdEU?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQM3Nldk54bHk1dzJETXZwNWh5ekdQWmJvcXJnY2dPSmc5WmQza1llQ1hheW4welVNS0N1d2loZEZVY3pNUWhON1dMNWdQRFdxcU43OTcxbEV2a1ZfYTk0ZXZ6SEJyd3V